iam:Passrole :-
  This is the methode which is internally called over the role if a role is attached to any aws service.
  If anyone[user/role] is attachubg a role to any AWs servie, the IAM policy the of that entity must have iam:PassRole => Allowed
  EX:- If user 'mufazzal' is attaching a role "myLambdaRole" to any lambda the IAM policy of 'mufazzal' must have below permission
    Effect: Allow
    Action "iam:PassRole"
    Resource "arn:aws:...:role/myLambdaRole"
So pass role authorize you to attach role to any aws service.


